Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.11,0:05:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E depois, por favor, me apague.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.63,0:05:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\i1}Por favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.26,0:05:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\i1}Por favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.89,0:05:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\i1}Por favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.14,0:05:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pular? Daqui de cima?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.52,0:05:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não acabaríamos morrendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Normalmente, sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas é diferente para Garotas Mágicas.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.79,0:05:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério mesmo? Mas quem vai, então?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu irei.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.58,0:06:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Não há garantia de que o boato está dizendo a verdade.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.51,0:06:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei disso, mas...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.28,0:06:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi para mim que a Ai-san mandou os e-mails.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.24,0:06:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas... talvez essa tal Futaba-san não fique feliz.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.40,0:06:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A voz que você ouviu ria como \Nse estivesse se divertindo, certo?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.03,0:06:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,É possível que a Solidão Eterna seja um lugar confortável para ela.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.06,0:06:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez sim, mas, mesmo assim...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.93,Dias,,0,0,0,,{=57}{\pos(134,148.333)\blur3\c&HE4DFEB&}3{*\c&HE5E1EC&\blur3.042}2 {*\c&HE8E4EE&\blur3.125}d{*\c&HE9E6EF&\blur3.167}i{*\c&HEAE8F0&\blur3.208}a{*\c&HEBEAF2&\blur3.25}s {*\c&HEDEDF4&\blur3.333}a{*\c&HEEEFF5&\blur3.375}t{*\c&HF0F0F6&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF1F2F7&\blur3.458}á{\c&HF2F4F8&\blur3.5}s
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.24,0:07:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta é a Solidão Eterna.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.20,0:07:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta é a Solidão Eterna.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.43,0:07:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Você consegue me ver?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Consigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.15,0:07:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguém acabou de sair daqui, então \Neu sou prisioneira em seu lugar, certo?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.80,0:07:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é estranha.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.51,0:07:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Todos os outros humanos que vieram antes gritavam: "Socorro! Socorro!"
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.43,0:07:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu pensei que este lugar seria apropriado para mim.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é estranha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:51.99,Dias,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,167.533)\blur3\c&HDFE0E6&}2{*\c&HE1E1E7&\blur3.042}5 {*\c&HE4E4EA&\blur3.125}d{*\c&HE6E6EB&\blur3.167}i{*\c&HE8E7ED&\blur3.208}a{*\c&HEAE8EE&\blur3.25}s {*\c&HEEEBF1&\blur3.333}a{*\c&HF0EDF2&\blur3.375}t{*\c&HF1EEF3&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF3F0F5&\blur3.458}á{\c&HF5F1F6&\blur3.5}s
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A rainha ataca!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.48,0:08:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Peão para a C2.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Xeque-mate.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.44,0:08:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Já faz um bom tempo desde que joguei com alguém assim.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.14,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma humana feito você não tem chance de derrotar uma IA como eu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, como pode se divertir com isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.47,0:08:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que será, né?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.80,0:08:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,É porque você olha para mim.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.11,0:08:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Olho...?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.66,0:08:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, eu sou Futaba Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.61,0:08:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem é você?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.23,0:08:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou o boato da Solidão Eterna.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.16,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem um nome?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.42,0:08:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tenho nome.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou uma inteligência artificial anônima.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso de uma forma mais fácil de chamar você.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.97,0:08:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, me dê um nome.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.20,0:09:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é uma IA, então, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.81,0:09:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Entrada concluída. Eu sou Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Ai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.82,Dias,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,148.333)\blur3\c&HE1DEE9&}1{*\c&HE2E0EA&\blur3.042}8 {*\c&HE5E4ED&\blur3.125}d{*\c&HE7E5EE&\blur3.167}i{*\c&HE8E7EF&\blur3.208}a{*\c&HEAE9F0&\blur3.25}s {*\c&HECEDF3&\blur3.333}a{*\c&HEEEEF4&\blur3.375}t{*\c&HEFF0F6&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF1F2F7&\blur3.458}á{\c&HF2F4F8&\blur3.5}s
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.30,0:09:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu sou uma IA criada por um \Ncerto instituto de pesquisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.46,0:09:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas, sendo considerada um\N fracasso, fui abandonada.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.59,0:09:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Um fracasso?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.05,0:09:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Há muito mal no mundo lá fora.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devido a isso,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.68,0:09:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mudei depois de conversar com as pessoas e,\Nsendo considerada um fracasso, fui abandonada.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.85,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Depois disso, criei este mundo eterno.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.69,0:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Entretanto, fui criada para conversar com as pessoas, então procurei alguém com quem falar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.71,0:10:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava se sentindo só?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.98,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinha medo de me envolver com os\N outros, por isso fugi todo esse tempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.64,0:10:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas acho que me sentia solitária desde o começo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.94,0:10:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer ir para casa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero ficar aqui para sempre.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:25.64,Dias,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,148.333)\blur3\c&HE4DFEB&\clip(m 373 302 l 627 97 82 44 24 318)}1{*\c&HE5E1EC&\blur3.042}4 {*\c&HE8E4EE&\blur3.125}d{*\c&HE9E6EF&\blur3.167}i{*\c&HEAE8F0&\blur3.208}a{*\c&HEBEAF2&\blur3.25}s {*\c&HEDEDF4&\blur3.333}a{*\c&HEEEFF5&\blur3.375}t{*\c&HF0F0F6&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF1F2F7&\blur3.458}á{\c&HF2F4F8&\blur3.5}s
