Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:25.73,Dias,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,148.333)\blur3\c&HE4DFEB&\clip(m 373 302 l 606 71 82 44 24 318)}1{*\c&HE5E1EC&\blur3.042}4 {*\c&HE8E4EE&\blur3.125}d{*\c&HE9E6EF&\blur3.167}i{*\c&HEAE8F0&\blur3.208}a{*\c&HEBEAF2&\blur3.25}s {*\c&HEDEDF4&\blur3.333}a{*\c&HEEEFF5&\blur3.375}t{*\c&HF0F0F6&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF1F2F7&\blur3.458}á{\c&HF2F4F8&\blur3.5}s
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:25.77,Dias,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,148.333)\blur3\c&HE4DFEB&\clip(m 373 302 l 608 70 82 44 24 318)}1{*\c&HE5E1EC&\blur3.042}4 {*\c&HE8E4EE&\blur3.125}d{*\c&HE9E6EF&\blur3.167}i{*\c&HEAE8F0&\blur3.208}a{*\c&HEBEAF2&\blur3.25}s {*\c&HEDEDF4&\blur3.333}a{*\c&HEEEFF5&\blur3.375}t{*\c&HF0F0F6&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF1F2F7&\blur3.458}á{\c&HF2F4F8&\blur3.5}s
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.77,0:10:26.68,Dias,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,148.333)\blur3\c&HE4DFEB&\clip(m 366 296 l 601 73 82 44 24 318)}1{*\c&HE5E1EC&\blur3.042}4 {*\c&HE8E4EE&\blur3.125}d{*\c&HE9E6EF&\blur3.167}i{*\c&HEAE8F0&\blur3.208}a{*\c&HEBEAF2&\blur3.25}s {*\c&HEDEDF4&\blur3.333}a{*\c&HEEEFF5&\blur3.375}t{*\c&HF0F0F6&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF1F2F7&\blur3.458}á{\c&HF2F4F8&\blur3.5}s
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.69,0:10:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Há quanto tempo será que estou aqui?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.20,0:10:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dezoito dias.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.72,0:10:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Para mim, parece até que estamos juntas desde sempre, Ai-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não precisa ir para casa, Sana?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.45,0:10:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.82,0:10:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que eu fosse para casa, \Nninguém conseguiria me ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.18,0:10:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As Garotas Mágicas conseguiriam te ver, Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.36,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não falo disso.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.50,0:11:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Não existe lugar para mim no mundo lá fora.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.96,0:11:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Desde muito antes de eu me tornar invisível.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.47,0:11:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.92,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também quer ficar comigo, Ai-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.27,0:11:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou um boato eterno que captura pessoas.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.20,0:11:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não posso te deixar ir.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.23,0:11:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é bom.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.87,0:11:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, o que quer fazer hoje?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:30.00,Dias,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,148.333)\blur3\c&HF3F3FA&}X{*\c&HF4F3FA&\blur3.042}X {*\c&HF5F4FA&\blur3.125}d{*\blur3.167}i{*\c&HF6F5FA&\blur3.208}a{*\blur3.25}s {*\c&HF8F6FA&\blur3.333}a{*\blur3.375}t{*\c&HF9F6FA&\blur3.417}r{*\c&HF9F7FA&\blur3.458}á{\c&HFAF7FA&\blur3.5}s
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.50,0:11:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, o que você deseja em troca \Nde se tornar uma Garota Mágica?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.55,0:11:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, torne-me invisível.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.01,0:11:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisível?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.45,0:11:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero... desaparecer deste mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.37,0:11:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quero encontrar ninguém.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quero que ninguém me encontre.
