Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.03,0:12:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nem percebo se a Futaba-san está por perto ou não.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aposto que nunca nem chamam o nome dela na classe.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.82,0:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Que inveja!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.06,0:12:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não vamos mais te olhar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.37,0:12:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Você nos envergonha.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Me desculpem... {\alpha&HFF&}Me desculpem... Me desculpem!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Me desculpem... Me desculpem... {\alpha&HFF&}Me desculpem!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.72,0:13:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Me desculpem... Me desculpem... Me desculpem!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.16,0:13:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Eu sinto mui—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.31,0:13:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um mundo com apenas eu.
