Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.16,0:16:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou voltar para o mundo lá fora.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.75,0:16:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá embora, por favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.79,0:16:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas—
