Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.70,0:19:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.76,0:19:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Me desculpe por demorar tanto.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.85,0:19:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu reescrevi as coordenadas da Alina \Ne a transportei para fora da barreira.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.88,0:19:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Todavia, ela certamente voltará logo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.26,0:19:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana, antes que ela volte...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.17,0:19:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, me destrua.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Não. Não!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.61,0:19:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu jamais poderia fazer isso!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.30,0:19:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou ficar com você para sempre, Ai-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.09,0:19:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A Alina me sujou inteira com a sua tinta.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.35,0:19:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela já começou a tomar a minha mente.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.69,0:19:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é a única que pode deter isso, Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.96,0:19:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ficar com você foi... muito divertido, Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.48,0:19:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.93,0:20:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana-chan!
